        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gordon Burns, Rosie Goldsmith\n- TV Shows: The Krypton Factor, A Word in Your Ear, A World in Your Ear, Crossing Continents\n- Organizations: ITV, BBC\n- Programs: North West Tonight\n\nFacts:\n- The Krypton Factor originally ran from 7 September 1977 to 20 November 1995.\n- Gordon Burns hosted The Krypton Factor during its original 18-year run from 1977 to 1995.\n- The Krypton Factor was usually broadcast on the ITV network on Mondays at 7 pm.\n- Gordon Burns hosted A Word in Your Ear.\n- From January 1997 to October 2011, Gordon Burns was the chief anchorman for the BBC regional news programme North West Tonight.\n- Rosie Goldsmith hosted Crossing Continents.\n- Rosie Goldsmith hosted A World in Your Ear.",
